<title>UK: TABLE - Minorco net earnings rise 9 pct. [CORRECTED 09:52 GMT]</title>
<headline>TABLE - Minorco net earnings rise 9 pct. [CORRECTED 09:52 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects currency in table from sterling to dollars.)</p>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   ($ million unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents)		1.77		   vs 1.63</p>
<p> Dividend (cents)	 0.63		   vs same</p>
<p> Net earnings	     396.4		  vs 365.0</p>
<p> Sales			5,013.7		vs 4,247</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings figures are pre exceptional items. Earnings after pre exceptionals fell to $335.7 million from $365.0 million. London-based and Luxemburg listed Minorco SA is controlled by South Africa's De Beers and Anglo American.</p>
